        {
          "title": {
            "type": "section_title",
            "text": "Authorisation",
            "layout_role": "section_heading",
            "llm_class": "section_title",
            "agreement": "agree",
            "attributes": {},
            "fields": [],
            "provenance": {
              "char_span": [
                495,
                508
              ],
              "page": 1,
              "bbox": [
                49.6,
                563.9,
                101.6,
                571.9
              ],
              "font_size": 8.0,
              "bold": true
            }
          },
          "level": 1,
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "legal_text",
              "text": "The authorised representative (only individual persons) is hereby permitted to obtain information regarding the UBS vested benefits account and\nthe UBS vested benefits custody account from the Vested Benefits Foundation of UBS AG (\"Vested Benefits Foundation\") on behalf of the pen-\nsion account holder.",
              "layout_role": "paragraph",
              "llm_class": "legal_text",
              "agreement": "agree",
              "attributes": {},
              "fields": [],
              "provenance": {
                "char_span": [
                  509,
                  812
                ],
                "page": 1,
                "bbox": [
                  49.6,
                  581.9,
                  545.4,
                  589.9
                ],
                "font_size": 8.0,
                "bold": false
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "legal_text",
              "text": "The pension account holder is aware that the Vested Benefits Foundation exercises no control whatsoever over the actions of the authorised rep-\nresentative that they chooses. Therefore, it shall be the authorised representative’s exclusive responsibility to notify the pension account holder of\ntheir actions.",
              "layout_role": "paragraph",
              "llm_class": "legal_text",
              "agreement": "agree",
              "attributes": {},
              "fields": [],
              "provenance": {
                "char_span": [
                  813,
                  1122
                ],
                "page": 1,
                "bbox": [
                  49.6,
                  617.9,
                  545.4,
                  625.9
                ],
                "font_size": 8.0,
                "bold": false
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "legal_text",
              "text": "This authorisation shall remain valid until it is expressly revoked by written communication sent to the Vested Benefits Foundation. This authorisa-\ntion shall remain in force without restriction even in the event of incapacity of the pension account holder.",
              "layout_role": "paragraph",
              "llm_class": "legal_text",
              "agreement": "agree",
              "attributes": {},
              "fields": [],
              "provenance": {
                "char_span": [
                  1123,
                  1381
                ],
                "page": 1,
                "bbox": [
                  49.6,
                  653.9,
                  545.4,
                  661.9
                ],
                "font_size": 8.0,
                "bold": false
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "legal_text",
              "text": "Once the Vested Benefits Foundation\nhas knowledge of the pension account holder’s death, this authorisation shall be considered void as of the date on which the information has\nbeen received.\nThe present authorisation shall be exclusively governed by and construed in accordance with Swiss law.\nThe place of performance of all obligations of both parties as well as the exclusive place of jurisdiction for any disputes arising out of and in\nconnection with the present authorisation is the Swiss foundation's seat.\nThe Vested Benefits Foundation is empowered, however, to assert its rights as well before any other competent authority, in which event exclu-\nsively Swiss law shall remain applicable.",
              "layout_role": "paragraph",
              "llm_class": "legal_text",
              "agreement": "agree",
              "attributes": {},
              "fields": [],
              "provenance": {
                "char_span": [
                  1382,
                  2081
                ],
                "page": 1,
                "bbox": [
                  49.6,
                  662.9,
                  545.4,
                  670.9
                ],
                "font_size": 8.0,
                "bold": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "subsections": []
        },
